# Godot generates a .uid sidecar for every .gd it scans, including the
# expected.*.gd goldens. Goldens are read as text and never loaded, so nothing
# refers to them by UID; ignore the sidecars to avoid UID churn (#6, see
# docs/corpus-golden-gd-verification.md).
tests/corpus/**/expected.*.gd.uid